      "title": "Viatris Gears Up to Report Q3 Earnings: Is a Beat in the Cards?",
      "summary": "Viatris (VTRS) is expected to report Q3 2026 revenues of $3.78 billion and earnings of 64 cents per share, likely beating consensus estimates. The company faces headwinds from FDA import alerts affecting 11 products, supply disruptions, and competitive pressures, but these are expected to be offset by new product growth and strength in branded markets, particularly in Greater China and Emerging Markets.",
