      "title": "Viatris to Buy Pacira for $1.65B to Expand Non-Opioid Pain Portfolio",
      "summary": "Viatris (VTRS) has agreed to acquire Pacira BioSciences (PCRX) for $1.65 billion in cash at $36.50 per share, expected to close by end of 2026. The acquisition adds two marketed pain therapies (Exparel and Zilretta) generating $350.5 million in H1 2026 sales, plus a mid-stage gene therapy candidate (PCRX-201) for knee osteoarthritis. The deal is expected to be immediately accretive to Viatris' financial metrics and strengthen its non-opioid pain management portfolio.",
